### EVENT MUSICIAN ENDPOINTS ###
### Note: Differentiated role and permission-based access control
### Read operations (GET): Require 'read:event_musician' permission + musician/auxiliar_musician/admin role
### Write operations (POST/PATCH): Require 'write:event_musician' permission + admin role only
### Delete operations (DELETE): Require 'delete:event_musician' permission + admin role only
### Musicians can view assignments but only admins can create/modify/delete assignments

### Get musicians assigned to an event
GET {{api}}/events/3/musicians
Authorization: Bearer {{user_token}}

###

### Assign a musician to an event
