### MUSICIAN AVAILABILITY ENDPOINTS ###
### Note: Strict role and permission-based access control
### Requires BOTH appropriate role (admin/musician/auxiliar_musician) AND specific permission
### Read operations (GET): Require 'read:musician_availability' permission + valid role
### Write operations (POST/PATCH): Require 'write:musician_availability' permission + valid role
### Delete operations (DELETE): Require 'delete:musician_availability' permission + valid role
### Users can manage their own availability based on assigned permissions

### Get availability for a specific musician (musicians/auxiliar_musicians can only view their own, admin can view any)
GET {{api}}/musician-availability/6
Authorization: Bearer {{user_token}}

### Check if a musician is available on a specific date
GET {{api}}/musician-availability/check/5/2026-04-15
Authorization: Bearer {{user_token}}

### Get musician availability dates by month (for calendar integration)
GET {{api}}/musician-availability/5/month/2026/5
Authorization: Bearer {{user_token}}

### Example response:
# {
#   "musician_id": 5,
#   "year": 2026,
#   "month": 5,
#   "unavailable_dates": [
#     {
#       "id": 30,
#       "unavailable_date": "2026-05-13",
#       "reason": "Lage Weekend"
#     },
#     {
#       "id": 31,
#       "unavailable_date": "2026-05-14",
#       "reason": "Evento Familiar"
#     }
#   ]
# }

### Create a new availability entry (musicians/auxiliar_musicians can only create for themselves, admin can create for any)
